{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14400","headline":"曾游 · 戴叔伦","name":"曾游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泊舟古城下，高阁快登眺。\n大江会彭蠡，羣峰豁玄峤。\n清影涵空明，黛色凝远照。\n碑留太史书，词刻长公调。\n绝粒感楚囚，丹衷犹照耀。\n怀哉不可招，凭阑一悲啸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}